{"reviewId": "2208600_7XM7duitu", "review": {"abstract": "一个人在60年人生的主要阶段中，有30年会参与经济生活，这30年里康波给予你的财富机会只有三次，不以你的主观意志为转移", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "18 演讲实录：人生就是一场康波", "chapterUid": 23, "content": "现在40岁以上的人，人生第一次机会在2008年，如果那时候买股票、房子，你的人生会很成功。2008年之前的人生机会是1999年，能抓住那次机会的人不多，所以2008年是第一次机会。第二次机会在2019年，最后一次在2030年左右，如果抓住一次，你就能够成为中产阶层，这就是人生发财靠康波的道理。", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "range": "4062-4121", "createTime": 1738889024, "title": "", "type": 1, "reviewId": "2208600_7XM7duitu", "userVid": 2208600, "topics": [], "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 23, "chapterTitle": "18 演讲实录：人生就是一场康波", "author": {"userVid": 2208600, "name": "ಠ开心就好༄", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/PiajxSqBRaEJGloXfGdYGZzJwMemv4aOP2V6UAks80SLg4Nb5xsObB5JpXBAytD9B5iaZDzECl4pX67dnQ7qgSIA/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "ಠ开心就好༄", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "MELODY  OF  THE  NIGHT", "medalInfo": {"id": "M13-20231016-10", "desc": "每周阅读挑战", "title": "完美阅读周", "levelIndex": 10}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 14, "likes": [{"userVid": 4403641, "name": "刘知行合一（闭关）", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0014-ZdzfKRiAXB81XFw5_M9hPda/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "nick": "刘知行合一（闭关）", "isV": 0, "vDesc": "财富积累:早起冥想读书记录跑步成长五部曲", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M4-0-500",